      "amount": "2 tbsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "lemon juice",
      "amount": "1 tbsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "water",
      "amount": "1 cup"
    },
    {
      "name": "vegetable oil",
      "amount": "enough for deep fry",
      "notes": "agemono style"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "In a bowl whisk together cornmeal, chickpea flour, baking powder, cumin, chili powder, salt and pepper.",
    "Stir in corn kernels, scallions and lemon juice until just combined.",
    "Add water gradually, mixing until a thick but pourable batter forms.",
    "Heat oil in a deep pan to 350°F (175°C).",
    "Drop spoonfuls of batter into the hot oil, leaving space between fritters.",
    "Fry each side for 3 to 4 minutes until golden brown and cooked through.",
    "Remove fritters with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels.",
    "Serve hot with a squeeze of lime or a spicy yogurt dip if desired."
  ],
